WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.410
In Frankfurt, a reader of German
plays your product walkthrough,

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.330
and every word is English.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.130
It was recorded once in English, and a
recording replays the text it captured.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.840
General Translation lets you replay a

5
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.210
walkthrough with gt-rrweb
in every language.

6
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:24.530
Install gt-rrweb, and turn on _tagIds
so each T component carries its hash.

7
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.390
Mount GTRecorder with
your app's catalog loader,

8
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.690
and record in English with
German and Japanese listed.

9
00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.670
Render GTReplayer with the saved bundle,

10
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.290
which carries the German
and Japanese text.

11
00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:41.710
In Frankfurt, the same walkthrough
switches in place to Japanese,

12
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.190
then German, with the same clicks.
